  "35078": {
    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nInitializes C64 hardware, unpacks and pre-shifts dual RAM charsets and sprites\nin VIC Bank 1 ($4000-$7FFF), draws the static playfield and HUD, installs the\nsplit-screen raster IRQ handler, and enters the foreground idle loop.\n\nInputs:  None (entered on cold boot via $8000 or RESTORE warm start via $8002/$0318)\nOutputs: None (never returns; spins in main_idle_loop at $8BDC after CLI)\nSide Effects:\n  - Sets NMINV ($0318/$0319) to $8906 and CINV ($0314/$0315) to $8BDF\n  - Selects VIC Bank 1 ($4000-$7FFF), multicolor char mode, border/bg/sprite colors\n  - Disables CIA1/CIA2 interrupts and clears pending CIA/VIC interrupt flags\n  - Temporarily banks in Character ROM via $00/$01 to copy 44 HUD/status glyphs\n  - Builds top river charset ($4800-$4FF7), bottom road charset ($5000-$56C7),\n    21 sprite blocks ($5800-$5D3F), Color RAM ($D800-$DBE7), and Screen RAM ($4400)\n  - Initializes attract-mode state via s_9594, enables raster IRQ at line $A1, and executes CLI\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=",
    "immediate_format": {
      "LowByte": 35078
    }
  },
