  "35807": {
    "user_side_comment": "Screen $4400 + bottom road/status charset $5000 (VIC bank 1)",
    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nTwo-phase VIC-II split-screen raster ISR ($0314/$0315) multiplexing scanline\n$A1 (road/status charset $5000, F1/F3/F5 & joystick input, timers, home-bay\nhazards, collisions, death/respawn, 2P swap, and frog hops) and scanline $FC\n(HUD/river charset $4800, road wipe, 3x lane scrolling, and SID playback).\n\nInputs:  zpa_2E (active raster trigger: $A1 or $FC), CIA1 $DC00/$DC01 ports,\n         VIC-II sprite state ($D002, $D010, $D015, $D01E), and gameplay state\n         globals (zpa_31, zpa_45..zpa_48, zpa_53..zpa_55, zpa_58, zpa_5B,\n         zpa_5E..zpa_5F, zpa_6E..zpa_6F, zpa_77, zpa_79, zpa_7D..zpa_7F,\n         zpa_81, zpf_82, zpa_84..zpa_86, zpf_A7, zpa_AE, zpa_B1, zpa_B3..B8)\nOutputs: zpa_2E (next raster trigger), input/mode state (zpa_46, zpa_54,\n         zpa_55, zpa_58, zpa_5B, zpa_5E..zpa_5F, zpa_7E), wipe state zpa_77,\n         timers/hazards (zpa_45, zpa_47..zpa_48, zpa_53, zpa_79, zpa_7D,\n         zpa_7F, zpa_86, zpa_AE, zpa_B1, zpa_B4..zpa_B8, zpf_A7), and player\n         turn/game-over state (zpa_81, zpf_82)\nSide Effects: Switches $D018 charset ($5000 / $4800), chains $D012/$D011 IRQ,\n         reconfigures CIA1 $DC00..$DC03, updates SID $D418 & streams, updates\n         Screen/Color RAM ($4400/$D800) & sprite pointers/enable, acks $D019,\n         and pops Y/X/A pushed by KERNAL $FF48 before RTI.\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-="
  },
