  "36620": {
    "user_side_comment": "Load current Sprite 0 (player frog) Y coordinate",
    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nSteps the player frog (Sprite 0) 1 pixel upward (clamped at home-bay ceiling\nY = $38) and, when the 16-pixel hop completes, sets the landed up-facing\nsprite, decrements the current row index, and queues a 10-point BCD bonus on\nnew upward row progress.\n\nInputs:  VIC-II $D001 (Sprite 0 Y position); zpa_45 (remaining hop pixel step\n         counter, $0F..$00); zpa_4A (current signed frog row, $0A down to\n         $FF/-1); zpa_4B (furthest upward signed row reached this life);\n         zpa_48 (30-frame prescaler, sampled via finish_frog_hop)\nOutputs: zpa_45 decremented ($FF on hop completion); Y = updated Sprite 0 Y\n         ($38..$E7). Mid-hop (zpa_45 >= 0): A and X preserved. On hop\n         completion (zpa_45 = $FF): X = $60; zpa_79 = $00; zpa_5D = zpa_48;\n         zpa_4A decremented; if signed zpa_4A < zpa_4B, zpa_4B = zpa_4A and\n         zpa_7A = $01 (+10 BCD pts); A, N, Z, C modified\nSide Effects: Updates VIC-II $D001 (Sprite 0 Y); on hop completion, writes\n              Sprite 0 pointer $47F8 = $60 (landed up frame) and reads VIC-II\n              $D01F to clear mid-hop sprite-background collisions\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-="
  },
