  "36658": {
    "user_side_comment": "Read current frog (Sprite 0) Y coordinate",
    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nSteps the player frog (Sprite 0) 1 pixel downward, clamped at the bottom\nsidewalk (Y = $E8), and decrements the 16-pixel hop counter; on the 16th\nstep, completes the downward hop with the idle-down frame ($6F) and advances\nthe frog's row index (clamped at row $0A).\n\nInputs:  $D001 = Sprite 0 Y coordinate; zpa_45 = remaining hop pixel counter\n         ($0F..$00); zpa_4A = current frog row index ($00..$0A);\n         zpa_48 = 30-frame prescaler count (sampled via finish_frog_hop)\nOutputs: Y = updated Sprite 0 Y coordinate (clamped to <= $E8);\n         zpa_45 decremented ($0E..$FF);\n         when hop completes (zpa_45 == $FF): X = $6F, A clobbered,\n         zpa_4A = min(zpa_4A + 1, $0A), a_47F8 = $6F, zpa_79 = $00,\n         zpa_5D = zpa_48 (otherwise A and X preserved)\nSide Effects: Writes VIC-II Sprite 0 Y position ($D001); on the 16th step,\n              calls finish_frog_hop (updates Sprite 0 pointer $47F8 and reads\n              $D01F to clear latched sprite-to-background collisions)\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-="
