    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nSteps the player frog (Sprite 0) 1 pixel left across its 9-bit VIC-II X\ncoordinate ($D010 bit 0:$D000), clamping at left border X = $0011 and\ncompleting the 16-pixel hop via finish_frog_hop when zpa_45 underflows.\n\nInputs:  $D000 = Sprite 0 X low byte; $D010 bit 0 = Sprite 0 X MSB;\n         zpa_45 = remaining hop pixel counter (0..15 for player hop, or >= 1\n         when drifted left by a river turtle lane); zpa_48 = 30-frame prescaler\nOutputs: $D000/$D010 bit 0 = decremented 9-bit X coordinate (clamped >= $0011);\n         zpa_2D = updated Sprite 0 X low byte; zpa_45 = zpa_45 - 1;\n         if zpa_45 < 0: X = $70, a_47F8 = $70, zpa_79 = $00, zpa_5D = zpa_48;\n         A clobbered (X clobbered only on hop completion; Y preserved)\nSide Effects: Updates VIC-II Sprite 0 X position ($D000/$D010); when hop\n              completes (zpa_45 < 0), updates Sprite 0 pointer ($47F8 = $70)\n              and reads $D01F to clear mid-hop background collisions\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-="
