    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nTicks the active river or road lane at round-robin cursor zpa_0F (8 down to 0,\ncalled 3 times per frame): when zpf_32,X expires, reloads its speed profile,\nadvances fine/coarse scroll state, redraws lane tiles, steps river companion/\nhazard sprites (lanes 0, 2, 3), and carries Sprite 0 horizontally on river lanes.\n\nInputs:  zpa_0F = active lane cursor (0..4 river, 5..8 road)\n         zpf_32[0..8] = per-lane frame delay countdown (1..2 ticks)\n         zpf_94[0..8] = per-lane fine scroll phase (0..3 multicolor px)\n         zpf_8B[0..8] = per-lane coarse scroll offset (0..49 columns)\n         lane_scroll_dir_tbl[0..8] = horizontal direction ($00 = left, $01 = right)\n         zpa_4A = player frog row, zpa_79 = hop active flag, zpa_31 = hop dir,\n         zpa_45 = hop pixel counter (plus globals read by sub-calls)\nOutputs: zpa_0F decremented (wraps $00 -> $08 via $FF -> X = $08);\n         on expired zpf_32,X: reloads zpf_32,X, clamps effective step zpf_3B,X\n         to (4 - old zpf_94,X), updates zpf_94,X (0..3) and zpf_8B,X (0..49),\n         sets zpa_78 = zpf_94,X; preserves zpa_45 via zpa_4C; zpa_51 = $00 on\n         frog drift; A, X, Y, N, Z, C modified\nSide Effects: Redraws lane objects in Screen RAM ($4400) via draw_lane_objects;\n              steps VIC-II Sprite 1 ($D002/$D010, Lady Frog on lane 3), Sprite 2\n              ($D004/$D010, river alligator jaws on lane 0), Sprite 3 & snake log\n              bounds (lane 2), and Sprite 0 ($D000/$D010, player frog river carry);\n              modifies ZP pointer/scratch workspace (zpa_67..zpa_6D, zpa_23, etc.)\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-="
