  "38297": {
    "user_side_comment": "Sound stream $08 = main 3-voice Frogger theme melody",
    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nStarts a new 1P or 2P game (F1) by queuing the 3-voice Frogger theme melody\n(stream $08) and running the shared session-reset tail ($95A0, also entered\nfrom s_9594 with X = $01 for standby/attract mode) to clear gameplay state,\ninitialize lane speeds, sprites, and Round 1, and clone Player 1's state into\nPlayer 2's backup buffers.\n\nInputs:  zpa_5E = player count flag ($00 = 1P, $01 = 2P)\n         zpa_5B = game speed mode ($00 = FAST, $01 = SLOW)\n         zpa_6E/zpa_6F = active SID stream state (for start_sound_stream)\n         (At reset_session_common $95A0: X = $00 for new game, X != $00 standby)\nOutputs: $0077..$00B1 cleared to $00 via clear_zp_range, then:\n         zpf_9D + 1 = $08 (lane 1 turtle dive offset), zpa_0F = $08\n         zpf_32[0..8], zpf_3B[0..8] loaded for speed tier 0; zpa_5F = $01 (P1)\n         zpf_82 + 1 = $01 in 1P mode ($00 in 2P); zpa_31 = $01, zpa_44 = $01\n         zpa_45 = $FF, zpa_47 = $1E, zpa_48 = $1E, zpa_4A/4B = $0A, zpa_B3 = $05\n         zpa_B9..BC = median snake bounds ($0182..$015A), zpa_BD..C0 = log snake\n         bounds ($00D0..$015A), zpa_C1 = $01, zpa_C2 = $0C, zpa_B6 = $00\n         New game (X = $00): zpa_77 = $FF, zpa_B2 = $05, zpa_AF = $01 (\"R=01\")\n         Standby (X != $00): zpa_7D = $FF, zpa_AC = $03, zpa_AF = $03, zpa_77 = $00\n         $0100..$0114 and zpf_C3..$00FE cloned from P1 state; A=$00, X=$01, Y=$00\nSide Effects: Queues SID theme stream $08 (via $9599); configures VIC-II sprites\n              ($D000..$D007, $D009, $D010, $D015, $D027), reads $D01E to clear\n              collision latches, and sets sprite pointers a_47F8..a_47FB.\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=",
