    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nTests whether the landed player frog on a river lane (rows 0..4) is\nhorizontally supported within the 200-multicolor-pixel ($C8) virtual ring span\nof an active log, river alligator, or non-submerged turtle group, triggering\nriver drowning ($6D splash sprite) if over open water or on a diving turtle\ngroup during its submerged phase ($09).\n\nInputs:  zpa_79 = hop-in-progress flag (0 = landed, non-zero = mid-hop)\n         zpa_7D = death/respawn/standby timer (0 = active/alive)\n         zpa_4A = signed frog row index (0..4 = river; -1 = bay; 5..10 = safe)\n         zpa_AC = level layout index (0..4, via load_lane_cfg_header)\n         zpf_8B[0..4] = per-lane coarse scroll offset in columns (0..49)\n         zpf_94[0..4] = per-lane fine scroll offset in multicolor px (0..3)\n         zpf_A2[0..4] = per-lane 12-step turtle dive phase (0..11; 9 = under)\n         VIC-II $D000 / $D010 bit 0 = 9-bit Sprite 0 (player frog) X position\n         zpa_B3 = remaining frog lives (decremented via trigger_frog_death)\nOutputs: Early exit (mid-hop, dying/standby, or non-river row): A clobbered,\n         X and Y preserved.\n         Active river check: A, X, Y clobbered; zpa_64 = zpa_4A; zpa_04/$05,\n         zpa_0D, zpa_0E set via load_lane_cfg_header; zpa_2D, zpa_60..$63,\n         zpa_65, zpa_66 updated with 2-px multicolor span calculations.\n         On drowning: zpa_53 = $6D, zpa_7D = $5A, zpa_B3 decremented, zpa_84 = 1\nSide Effects: On drowning, calls trigger_frog_death (sets VIC-II $D027 = $0D\n              light green and queues SID drowning SFX stream $03); else None\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-="
