    "user_line_comment": "=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\nCalculates the BCD home-bay arrival score bonus from remaining timer ticks and\nlady-frog/fly pickups, updates the \"TIME XX\" display value and bonus popup\nsprite (or hides Sprite 0), arms the respawn delay, and returns the BCD score\ndelta in A.\n\nInputs:  X = remaining life timer ticks (zpa_47, 0..30 binary)\n         zpa_4F = home-bay pickup count (0 = none, 1 = lady frog or fly, 2 = both)\nOutputs: A = packed BCD score bonus in units of 10 pts (stored to zpa_7A by caller)\n         X = $05 (clobbered)\n         zpa_59 = packed BCD remaining time ($00-$60) for \"TIME XX\" HUD status\n         zpa_7D = $05 (post-bay respawn countdown timer)\nSide Effects: Temporarily enables 6502 decimal mode (SED..CLD); clears $D015\n              bit 0 to hide Sprite 0 when zpa_4F == 0, or writes $65 (\"200\") /\n              $66 (\"400\") to Sprite 0 pointer a_47F8 when zpa_4F >= 1.\n              Note: CPX #$01 sets C=1 while SED is active, so ADC #$14 / #$28\n              awards +150 / +290 pts ($15 / $29 BCD) instead of +200 / +400 pts.\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-="
